// purpose: Emotet SHA256 IOC Feed Source: Talos Intelligence Feed information: https://blog.talosintelligence.com/emotet-coming-in-hot/ Feed link: https://github.com/Cisco-Talos/IOCs/blob/main/2022/11/Emotet_parents.txt
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Threat%20Hunting/TI%20Feed%20-%202022-TalosEmotetSHA256.md
